INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('guia-matthieu/clawfu-skills/challenger-sale', 'challenger-sale', 'guia-matthieu', 'clawfu-skills', 'community', 'challenger-sale guia-matthieu clawfu-skills community The Challenger Sale skill teaches AI agents to control sales conversations for complex B2B sales, commoditized markets, and sophisticated buyers. It helps AI agents tailor and take control of sales conversations. 挑战者销售技巧是一种研究支持的方法，用于教导、定制和控制销售对话，特别适用于复杂B2B销售和同质化市场 チャレンジャー・セールは、研究によって裏付けられた方法で、販売対話を教え、カスタマイズし、コントロールすることを目的としています。特に複雑なB2B販売と同質市場に適しています 챌린저 세일 스킬은 연구에 의거한 방법으로 판매 대화를 가르치고, 맞춤화하고, 제어하는 것을 목표로 합니다. 특히 복잡한 B2B 판매와 동형시장에 적합합니다 La venta desafiante es una metodología de ventas que enseña a los agentes de IA a tomar el control de las conversaciones de ventas B2B La vente défi est une méthode de vente qui enseigne aux agents IA à prendre le contrôle des conversations de vente B2B Der Challenger-Verkauf ist eine Verkaufsmethode, die KI-Agents beibringt, die Kontrolle über B2B-Verkaufsgespräche zu übernehmen A venda desafiadora é uma metodologia comprovada para melhorar a eficácia nas vendas B2B complexas, permitindo que os vendedores ensinem, personalizem e controlem as conversas de vendas Challenger Sale - это исследованная методология, используемая лучшими исполнителями для обучения, адаптации и контроля продажных разговоров مبيعات التحدى هي منهجية مدعومة بالبحوث لتحسين فعالية مبيعات الب2ب المعقدة، مما يسمح للمبيعات بتعليم وتailoring والتحكم في محادثات المبيعات how to use challenger-sale what is challenger-sale challenger-sale alternative challenger-sale vs spin selling challenger-sale install challenger-sale setup guide challenger-sale for AI agents complex B2B sales strategies commoditized market sales techniques AIエージェント 挑战者销售技巧 复杂B2B销售 同质化市场 大型交易 销售对话教导 定制化销售解决方案 研究支持的销售方法 Enables AI agents to teach for complex B2B sales Tailors sales conversations for commoditized markets Takes control of sales conversations for sophisticated buyers Supports solution selling that requires changing Facilitates large deals requiring consensus among stakeholders Handles sales conversations where buyers have done their research Challenger-sale is a research-backed methodology for AI agents to teach, tailor, and take control of sales conversations in complex B2B sales environments.');
