ing 사용법","AI 에이전트란","Convex Component Authoring 대체","Convex Component Authoring 설치","Convex Component Authoring 튜토리얼","AI 학습 플랫폼","컴포넌트 개발 도구","무료 학습 플랫폼"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","creación de componentes convexos","plataforma de aprendizaje en línea gratuita","cómo utilizar herramientas de AI","alternativas a plataformas de aprendizaje en línea","instalación de herramientas de AI","guía de configuración de plataformas de aprendizaje en línea"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les développeurs","création de composants convexes","plateforme d''apprentissage en ligne gratuite","comment utiliser les outils d''IA","alternatives aux plateformes d''apprentissage en ligne","installation des outils d''IA","guide de configuration des plateformes d''apprentissage en ligne"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","Erstellung von konvexen Komponenten","kostenloses Online-Lernplattform","wie man KI-Tools verwendet","Alternativen zu Online-Lernplattformen","Installation von KI-Tools","Einrichtungsanleitung für Online-Lernplattformen"],"pt":["como usar convex component authoring","o que é convex component authoring","ferramentas de ia para aprendizado","alternativas para convex component authoring","convex component authoring vs outras ferramentas","instalar convex component authoring","guia de configuração do convex component authoring"],"ru":["как использовать Convex Component Authoring","что такое Convex Component Authoring","инструменты ИИ для обучения","альтернативы Convex Component Authoring","Convex Component Authoring vs другие инструменты","установка Convex Component Authoring","руководство по настройке Convex Component Authoring"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Convex Component Authoring","ما هو Convex Component Authoring","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتعلم","بديل Convex Component Authoring","Convex Component Authoring مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت Convex Component Authoring","دليل إعداد Convex Component Authoring"]}},"owner":"nakafaai","repo":"nakafa.com","repoPath":"nakafaai/nakafa.com","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T08:25:24.733Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convex-component-authoring","description":"How to create, structure, and publish self-contained Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","components","reusable","packages","npm"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex component","body":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex components are self-contained packages that include:\n- Database tables (isolated from the main app)\n- Functions (queries, mutations, actions)\n- TypeScript types and validators\n- Optional frontend hooks\n\n### Component Structure\n\n```\nmy-convex-component/\n├── package.json\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── README.md\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts           # Main exports\n│   ├── component.ts       # Component definition\n│   ├── schema.ts          # Component schema\n│   └── functions/\n│       ├── queries.ts\n│       ├── mutations.ts\n│       └── actions.ts\n└── convex.config.ts       # Component configuration\n```\n\n### Creating a Component\n\n#### 1. Component Configuration\n\n```typescript\n// convex.config.ts\nimport { defineComponent } from \"convex/server\";\n\nexport default defineComponent(\"myComponent\");\n```\n\n#### 2. Component Schema\n\n```typescript\n// src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  // Tables are isolated to this component\n  items: defineTable({\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  }).index(\"by_name\", [\"name\"]),\n  \n  config: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    value: v.any(),\n  }).index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"]),\n});\n```\n\n#### 3. Component Definition\n\n```typescript\n// src/component.ts\nimport { defineComponent, ComponentDefinition } from \"convex/server\";\nimport schema from \"./schema\";\nimport * as queries from \"./functions/queries\";\nimport * as mutations from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\nconst component = defineComponent(\"myComponent\", {\n  schema,\n  functions: {\n    ...queries,\n    ...mutations,\n  },\n});\n\nexport default component;\n```\n\n#### 4. Component Functions\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/queries.ts\nimport { query } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const list = query({\n  args: {\n    limit: v.optional(v.number()),\n  },\n  returns: v.array(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  })),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .take(args.limit ?? 10);\n  },\n});\n\nexport const get = query({\n  args: { name: v.string() },\n  returns: v.union(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  }), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_name\", (q) => q.eq(\"name\", args.name))\n      .unique();\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const create = mutation({\n  args: {\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"items\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"items\", {\n      name: args.name,\n      data: args.data,\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n\nexport const update = mutation({\n  args: {\n    id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.patch(args.id, { data: args.data });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\nexport const remove = mutation({\n  args: { id: v.id(\"items\") },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.delete(args.id);\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n#### 5. Main Exports\n\n```typescript\n// src/index.ts\nexport { default as component } from \"./component\";\nexport * from \"./functions/queries\";\nexport * from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\n// Export types for consumers\nexport type { Id } from \"./_generated/dataModel\";\n```\n\n### Using a Component\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"myComponent\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s code\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction MyApp() {\n  // Access component functions through the app''s API\n  const items = useQuery(api.myComponent.list, { limit: 10 });\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.myComponent.create);\n  \n  return (\n    <div>\n      {items?.map((item) => (\n        <div key={item._id}>{item.name}</div>\n      ))}\n      <button onClick={() => createItem({ name: \"New\", data: {} })}>\n        Add Item\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Component Configuration Options\n\n```typescript\n// convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\n// Basic usage\napp.use(myComponent);\n\n// With custom name\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"customName\" });\n\n// Multiple instances\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance1\" });\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance2\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n### Providing Component Hooks\n\n```typescript\n// src/hooks.ts\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { FunctionReference } from \"convex/server\";\n\n// Type-safe hooks for component consumers\nexport function useMyComponent(api: {\n  list: FunctionReference<\"query\">;\n  create: FunctionReference<\"mutation\">;\n}) {\n  const items = useQuery(api.list, {});\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.create);\n  \n  return {\n    items,\n    createItem,\n    isLoading: items === undefined,\n  };\n}\n```\n\n### Publishing a Component\n\n#### package.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-convex-component\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"A reusable Convex component\",\n  \"main\": \"dist/index.js\",\n  \"types\": \"dist/index.d.ts\",\n  \"files\": [\n    \"dist\",\n    \"convex.config.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"tsc\",\n    \"prepublishOnly\": \"npm run build\"\n  },\n  \"peerDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.17.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"convex\",\n    \"component\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n#### tsconfig.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2020\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"declaration\": true,\n    \"outDir\": \"dist\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src/**/*\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Rate Limiter Component\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  requests: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    timestamp: v.number(),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"])\n    .index(\"by_key_and_time\", [\"key\", \"timestamp\"]),\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const checkLimit = mutation({\n  args: {\n    key: v.string(),\n    limit: v.number(),\n    windowMs: v.number(),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({\n    allowed: v.boolean(),\n    remaining: v.number(),\n    resetAt: v.number(),\n  }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const now = Date.now();\n    const windowStart = now - args.windowMs;\n    \n    // Clean old entries\n    const oldEntries = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key_and_time\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"key\", args.key).lt(\"timestamp\", windowStart)\n      )\n      .collect();\n    \n    for (const entry of oldEntries) {\n      await ctx.db.delete(entry._id);\n    }\n    \n    // Count current window\n    const currentRequests = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key\", (q) => q.eq(\"key\", args.key))\n      .collect();\n    \n    const remaining = Math.max(0, args.limit - currentRequests.length);\n    const allowed = remaining > 0;\n    \n    if (allowed) {\n      await ctx.db.insert(\"requests\", {\n        key: args.key,\n        timestamp: now,\n      });\n    }\n    \n    const oldestRequest = currentRequests[0];\n    const resetAt = oldestRequest \n      ? oldestRequest.timestamp + args.windowMs \n      : now + args.windowMs;\n    \n    return { allowed, remaining: remaining - (allowed ? 1 : 0), resetAt };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// Usage in consuming app\nimport { useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction useRateLimitedAction() {\n  const checkLimit = useMutation(api.rateLimiter.checkLimit);\n  \n  return async (action: () => Promise<void>) => {\n    const result = await checkLimit({\n      key: \"user-action\",\n      limit: 10,\n      windowMs: 60000,\n    });\n    \n    if (!result.allowed) {\n      throw new Error(`Rate limited. Try again at ${new Date(result.resetAt)}`);\n    }\n    \n    await action();\n  };\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Keep component tables isolated (don''t reference main app tables)\n- Export clear TypeScript types for consumers\n- Document all public functions and their arguments\n- Use semantic versioning for component releases\n- Include comprehensive README with examples\n- Test components in isolation before publishing\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Cross-referencing tables** - Component tables should be self-contained\n2. **Missing type exports** - Export all necessary types\n3. **Hardcoded configuration** - Use component options for customization\n4. **No versioning** - Follow semantic versioning\n5. **Poor documentation** - Document all public APIs\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Components: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T09:45:44.723Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced component-based architecture for reusable and modular code, particularly those utilizing Convex components","zh":"适合需要高级基于组件的架构的AI代理，特别是那些使用Convex组件的代理，以实现可重用和模块化的代码","ja":"Convexコンポーネントを利用するものを含む、高度なコンポーネントベースのアーキテクチャが必要なAIエージェントに適しています。再利用可能でモジュラコードを実現することができます","ko":"Convex 컴포넌트를 이용하는 것을 포함하여 고급 컴포넌트 기반 아키텍처가 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 재사용 가능하고 모듈화된 코드를 구현할 수 있습니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una arquitectura de componentes avanzada y basada en componentes para código reutilizable y modular, particularmente aquellos que utilizan componentes Convex","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une architecture de composants avancée et basée sur des composants pour un code réutilisable et modulaire, en particulier ceux utilisant des composants Convex","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agenten, die eine fortschrittliche komponentenbasierte Architektur für wiederverwendbaren und modularen Code benötigen, insbesondere solche, die Convex-Komponenten nutzen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de arquitetura de componentes avançada e baseada em componentes para código reutilizável e modular, particularmente aqueles que utilizam componentes Convex","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым требуется продвинутая архитектура, основанная на компонентах, для многократного использования и модульного кода, особенно тех, которые используют компоненты Convex","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوسائط الذكية التي تحتاج إلى هندسة متقدمة قائمة على المكونات لإعادة استخدام الشفرة وتنظيمها وتجزئتها، خاصة تلك التي تستخدم مكونات Convex"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management using the latest Convex documentation and APIs, facilitating seamless sharing across projects","zh":"赋予代理创建自包含、可重用的Convex组件的能力，具有适当的隔离、导出和依赖管理，使用最新的Convex文档和API，实现项目间的无缝共享","ja":"最新のConvexドキュメントおよびAPIを使用し、適切な分離、エクスポート、依存関係管理を実現することで、Convexコンポーネントを自包含的かつ再利用可能なものにするエージェントの能力を提供し、プロジェクト間のシームレスな共有を促進します","ko":"최신 Convex 문서 및 API를 사용하여 적절한 분리, 내보내기 및 의존성 관리를 통해Convex 컴포넌트를 자체 포함형 및 재사용 가능한 컴포넌트로 만드는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하여 프로젝트 간의 무шов한 공유를 촉진합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes Convex autocontenidos, reutilizables con una adecuada aislación, exportaciones y gestión de dependencias utilizando la última documentación y API de Convex, lo que facilita una compartición fluida entre proyectos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants Convex autocontenus, réutilisables avec une isolation appropriée, des exportations et une gestion des dépendances en utilisant la dernière documentation et les API Convex, ce qui facilite un partage sans heurts entre les projets","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, selbstenthalte, wiederverwendbare Convex-Komponenten mit ordnungsgemäßer Isolation, Exporten und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung zu erstellen, indem sie die neueste Convex-Dokumentation und APIs verwenden, was eine nahtlose Weitergabe zwischen Projekten erleichtert","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes Convex autocontidos, reutilizáveis, com isolamento adequado, exportações e gerenciamento de dependências, utilizando a documentação e as APIs Convex mais recentes, facilitando a partilha sem interrupções entre projetos","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность создавать самодостаточные, многократно используемые компоненты Convex с правильным изоляцией, экспортами и управлением зависимостями, используя последнюю документацию и API Convex, что облегчает бесперебойное обмен между проектами","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء مكونات Convex متكاملة ومتعددة الاستخدامات مع عزلเหมาะ وتصدير وإدارة التبعيات باستخدام أحدث وثائق وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات Convex، مما يسهل المشاركة السلسة عبر المشاريع"},"useCases":{"en":["Authoring reusable Convex components for efficient project sharing","Implementing dependency management for Convex components across multiple projects","Exporting and isolating Convex components for modular code architecture"],"zh":["为高效的项目共享编写可重用的Convex组件","在多个项目中实现Convex组件的依赖管理","导出和隔离Convex组件以实现模块化代码架构"],"ja":["効率的なプロジェクト共有のための再利用可能なConvexコンポーネントの作成","複数のプロジェクト間でConvexコンポーネントの依存関係管理の実装","モジュラコードアーキテクチャを実現するためのConvexコンポーネントのエクスポートと分離"],"ko":["효율적인 프로젝트 공유를 위한 재사용 가능한 Convex 컴포넌트 작성","複数의 프로젝트 간 Convex 컴포넌트의 의존성 관리 구현","모듈화된 코드 아키텍처를 구현하기 위한 Convex 컴포넌트의 내보내기 및 분리"],"es":["Creación de componentes Convex reutilizables para un intercambio de proyectos eficiente","Implementación de la gestión de dependencias para componentes Convex en varios proyectos","Exportación y aislamiento de componentes Convex para una arquitectura de código modular"],"fr":["Création de composants Convex réutilisables pour un partage de projets efficace","Mise en œuvre de la gestion des dépendances pour les composants Convex dans plusieurs projets","Exportation et isolation des composants Convex pour une architecture de code modulaire"],"de":["Erstellung wiederverwendbarer Convex-Komponenten für einen effizienten Projektwechsel","Implementierung der Abhängigkeitsverwaltung für Convex-Komponenten in mehreren Projekten","Export und Isolation von Convex-Komponenten für eine modulare Code-Architektur"],"pt":["Criação de componentes Convex reutilizáveis para partilha eficiente de projetos","Implementação de gerenciamento de dependências para componentes Convex em vários projetos","Exportação e isolamento de componentes Convex para arquitetura de código modular"],"ru":["Создание многократно используемых компонентов Convex для эффективного обмена проектами","Реализация управления зависимостями для компонентов Convex в нескольких проектах","Экспорт и изоляция компонентов Convex для модульной архитектуры кода"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات Convex قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لتبادل المشاريع بكفاءة","تنفيذ إدارة التبعيات لمكونات Convex عبر مشاريع متعددة","تصدير وعزل مكونات Convex للهندسة المعمارية للشفرة المتجزئة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Convex documentation and APIs","Dependent on compatibility with Convex component authoring guidelines"],"zh":["需要访问Convex文档和API","依赖于Convex组件作者指南的兼容性"],"ja":["ConvexドキュメントおよびAPIへのアクセスが必要","Convexコンポーネント作成ガイドラインとの互換性に依存"],"ko":["Convex 문서 및 API에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","Convex 컴포넌트 작성 가이드라인과의 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación y API de Convex","Dependiente de la compatibilidad con las directrices de autoría de componentes Convex"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation et aux API Convex","Dépend de la compatibilité avec les directives d''écriture de composants Convex"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Convex-Dokumentation und APIs","Hängt von der Kompatibilität mit den Richtlinien für die Erstellung von Convex-Komponenten ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso à documentação e às APIs Convex","Depende da compatibilidade com as diretrizes de autorização de componentes Convex"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации и API Convex","Зависит от совместимости с рекомендациями по созданию компонентов Convex"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى وثائق وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات Convex","يعتمد على التوافق مع إرشادات تأليف مكونات Convex"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"561346aded0969635fc3f32ae6d465f882266b6be20b4038c7a55645ff6db7c2","qualityScore":65}');
