s"],"fr":["Authentification sécurisée avec GitHub","Accès à l''API GitHub avec des limites de débit plus élevées","Recherche de référentiels de code ouvert","Récupération de métadonnées de référentiel","Exécution de requêtes GraphQL pour des recherches plus rapides"],"de":["Sichere Authentifizierung mit GitHub","Zugriff auf die GitHub-API mit höheren Rate Limits","Suche nach Open-Source-Repositories","Abruf von Repository-Metadaten","Ausführung von GraphQL-Abfragen für schnellere Suchen"],"pt":["Autenticação segura com o GitHub","Acesso à API do GitHub com limite de taxa mais alto","Suporte a consultas GraphQL","Integração com LifeLock","Rastreamento de dias de trabalho","Gerenciamento de tarefas"],"ru":["Безопасная аутентификация с GitHub","Доступ к API GitHub с более высоким лимитом скорости","Поддержка запросов GraphQL","Интеграция с LifeLock","Отслеживание рабочих дней","Управление задачами"],"ar":["المصادقة الآمنة مع جيت هب","الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيت هب بحد سرعة أعلى","دعم استفسارات GraphQL","التكامل مع LifeLock","تتبع أيام العمل","إدارة المهام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub CLI","GraphQL","GitHub API","开发效率","安全访问","命令行工具","开源仓库","仓库元数据"],"ja":["GitHub CLI","GraphQL","GitHub API","開発効率","安全なアクセス","コマンドラインツール","オープンソース リポジトリ","リポジトリ メタデータ"],"ko":["GitHub CLI","GraphQL","GitHub API","개발 효율성","안전한 액세스","명령줄 도구","오픈 소스 저장소","저장소 메타데이터"],"es":["github cli","autenticación github","graphql","api github","repositorios de código abierto","metadatos de repositorio","consultas graphql"],"fr":["github cli","authentification github","graphql","api github","référentiels de code ouvert","métadonnées de référentiel","requêtes graphql"],"de":["github cli","github authentifizierung","graphql","github api","open-source-repositories","repository-metadaten","graphql-abfragen"],"pt":["GitHub CLI","Autenticação GitHub","GraphQL","LifeLock","Gerenciamento de tarefas","Rastreamento de dias de trabalho","API GitHub","Limite de taxa"],"ru":["GitHub CLI","Аутентификация GitHub","GraphQL","LifeLock","Управление задачами","Отслеживание рабочих дней","API GitHub","Лимит скорости"],"ar":["جيت هب CLI","مصادقة جيت هب","GraphQL","LifeLock","إدارة المهام","تتبع أيام العمل","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات جيت هب","حد السرعة"]}},"owner":"Lordsisodia","repo":"siso-agency-internal","repoPath":"Lordsisodia/siso-agency-internal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.570Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-cli","description":"GitHub CLI authentication and GraphQL API usage for safe GitHub operations","version":"1.0.0","tags":["github","cli","authentication","graphql","api","security"],"bodyPreview":"# Skill: GitHub CLI Auth + GraphQL Usage\n\n<context>\n<trigger>\nUse this skill when:\n- You need to connect this repo''s automation/agents to GitHub safely (without pasting tokens into docs or chat)\n- You want reliable GitHub API access (higher rate limits than anonymous), especially for:\n  - Searching OSS repos\n  - Fetching repo metadata\n  - Running GraphQL queries for richer/faster lookups\n- You want a repeatable setup teammates can follow\n</trigger>\n\n<goal>\nGet GitHub CLI (`gh`) authenticated and","body":"# Skill: GitHub CLI Auth + GraphQL Usage\n\n<context>\n<trigger>\nUse this skill when:\n- You need to connect this repo''s automation/agents to GitHub safely (without pasting tokens into docs or chat)\n- You want reliable GitHub API access (higher rate limits than anonymous), especially for:\n  - Searching OSS repos\n  - Fetching repo metadata\n  - Running GraphQL queries for richer/faster lookups\n- You want a repeatable setup teammates can follow\n</trigger>\n\n<goal>\nGet GitHub CLI (`gh`) authenticated and verified, then use it to call GitHub''s APIs (REST + GraphQL) safely.\n</goal>\n\n<key_idea>\nPrefer `gh auth login` over manually managing PATs:\n- `gh` stores credentials in your OS keychain (or `gh`''s credential store) instead of committing anything\n- Scripts can call `gh api ...` without exporting tokens to shell history\n</key_idea>\n\n<recommended_auth_method>\nIn order of preference:\n1. **GitHub CLI (`gh auth login`)** for local agentic runs (best default)\n2. **GitHub App** (best for team/server automation): short-lived tokens, fine-grained permissions, easy rotation\n3. **Fine-grained PAT** if you *must* use a PAT (prefer over \"classic\")\n4. **Classic PAT** only as a last resort (broad scopes; easier to over-grant)\n</recommended_auth_method>\n\n<inputs_to_collect>\n- **Host:** GitHub.com (default), or GitHub Enterprise Server (GHES) host (e.g. `github.company.com`)\n- **Access needs:**\n  - Public repos only, or private repos too?\n  - Do you need org data (teams/repos in an org)?\n- **Environment:**\n  - macOS (Homebrew), Linux (apt/yum), Windows (winget/choco)\n</inputs_to_collect>\n\n<artifacts>\n- A verified `gh` authentication state (`gh auth status` output shows \"Logged in\")\n- Optional: a small \"smoke test\" GraphQL query that returns your `viewer.login`\n</artifacts>\n</context>\n\n<instructions>\n<workflow>\n<phase name=\"Installation\">\n<step>Install GitHub CLI (`gh`)</step>\n\n<commands>\n# macOS (Homebrew)\nbrew install gh\ngh --version\n\n# Linux (common)\n# If you already have gh installed:\ngh --version\n\n# If not, install using your distro''s package manager\n# or follow GitHub CLI install instructions for your distro\n\n# Windows\n# Use winget or Chocolatey, then confirm:\ngh --version\n</commands>\n</phase>\n\n<phase name=\"Authentication\">\n<step>Authenticate with GitHub</step>\n\n<variant name=\"GitHub.com (most common)\">\n<commands>\ngh auth login\n</commands>\n<recommended_answers>\n- **What account do you want to log into?** GitHub.com\n- **What is your preferred protocol for Git operations?** HTTPS (recommended) or SSH (if you already use SSH keys)\n- **Authenticate Git with your GitHub credentials?** Yes\n- **How would you like to authenticate?** \"Login with a web browser\" (device flow) is easiest + safest\n</recommended_answers>\n</variant>\n\n<variant name=\"GitHub Enterprise Server (GHES)\">\n<commands>\ngh auth login --hostname github.company.com\n</commands>\n</variant>\n\n<variant name=\"Existing PAT\">\n<commands>\n# macOS (token copied to clipboard)\npbpaste | gh auth login --with-token\n\n# Linux (example with xclip)\nxclip -selection clipboard -o | gh auth login --with-token\n</commands>\n<notes>\n- `gh auth login --with-token` reads the token from stdin\n- For OSS discovery + GraphQL reads, you usually don''t need extra scopes beyond defaults unless you hit a specific \"resource not accessible\" error\n</notes>\n</variant>\n</phase>\n\n<phase name=\"Verification\">\n<step>Verify you''re authenticated</step>\n<commands>\ngh auth status\n</commands>\n<expected_output>\n- You are logged in\n- The hostname (github.com or your GHES host)\n</expected_output>\n</phase>\n\n<phase name=\"Scopes (Optional)\">\n<step>Ensure `gh` has the right scopes</step>\n<important>\n**GraphQL doesn''t require a special \"GraphQL scope\".**\nGraphQL uses the *same token permissions* as REST. If your token can read a resource via REST, it can usually read it via GraphQL too.\n</important>\n\n<typical_needs>\n- Public-only discovery: usually fine by default\n- Org metadata: may require `read:org`\n- Private repos: may require `repo`\n</typical_needs>\n\n<commands>\n# Refresh auth / request additional scopes\ngh auth refresh --scopes \"read:org\"\n</commands>\n<notes>\nAdjust scopes based on your needs. Keep them minimal.\n</notes>\n</phase>\n</workflow>\n\n<graphql_usage>\n<phase name=\"Smoke Test\">\n<step>Quick test: \"Who am I?\"</step>\n<commands>\ngh api graphql -f query=''query { viewer { login } }''\n</commands>\n<expected_output>\n```json\n{ \"data\": { \"viewer\": { \"login\": \"your-handle\" } } }\n```\n</expected_output>\n</phase>\n\n<phase name=\"Query Variables\">\n<step>Use variables (recommended pattern)</step>\n<example>\nFetch basic repo metadata:\n```bash\ngh api graphql \\\n  -f query=''\n    query($owner:String!, $name:String!) {\n      repository(owner:$owner, name:$name) {\n        nameWithOwner\n        url\n        stargazerCount\n        pushedAt\n        primaryLanguage { name }\n      }\n    }'' \\\n  -f owner=''illacloud'' \\\n  -f name=''illa-builder''\n```\n</example>\n</phase>\n\n<phase name=\"Query Files\">\n<step>Put queries in a file (best for larger queries)</step>\n<commands>\n# Create query.graphql\ncat > query.graphql <<''EOF''\nquery($login:String!) {\n  user(login: $login) {\n    repositories(first: 5, orderBy: {field: UPDATED_AT, direction: DESC}) {\n      nodes {\n        nameWithOwner\n        url\n        stargazerCount\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\nEOF\n\n# Run it\ngh api graphql -f query=@query.graphql -f login=''your-handle''\n</commands>\n</phase>\n\n<phase name=\"Rate Limits\">\n<step>Understanding rate limits</step>\n<notes>\nGraphQL can be more efficient than REST because you can fetch multiple fields in one request.\nEven with `gh` auth, rate limits still exist — but you''ll generally get much higher limits than anonymous calls.\n</notes>\n</phase>\n\n<phase name=\"Repository Search\">\n<step>High-signal OSS discovery via search</step>\n<commands>\n# Create repo-search.graphql\ncat > repo-search.graphql <<''EOF''\nquery($q: String!, $first: Int!, $endCursor: String) {\n  search(type: REPOSITORY, query: $q, first: $first, after: $endCursor) {\n    repositoryCount\n    pageInfo { endCursor hasNextPage }\n    nodes {\n      ... on Repository {\n        nameWithOwner\n        url\n        description\n        stargazerCount\n        pushedAt\n        licenseInfo { spdxId name }\n        primaryLanguage { name }\n        repositoryTopics(first: 12) { nodes { topic { name } } }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\nEOF\n\n# Run a single page (50 results)\ngh api graphql \\\n  -f query=@repo-search.graphql \\\n  -f q=''topic:shopify-hydrogen stars:>50 archived:false'' \\\n  -F first=50\n\n# Paginate (pass the previous endCursor)\ngh api graphql \\\n  -f query=@repo-search.graphql \\\n  -f q=''topic:headless-commerce stars:>100 archived:false'' \\\n  -F first=50 \\\n  -f endCursor=''CURSOR_FROM_PREVIOUS_RESPONSE''\n</commands>\n</phase>\n\n<phase name=\"Auto-pagination\">\n<step>Use `--paginate` for automatic cursor handling</step>\n<commands>\ngh api graphql --paginate --slurp \\\n  -f query=@repo-search.graphql \\\n  -f q=''topic:ecommerce stars:>200 archived:false'' \\\n  -F first=50 \\\n  -F endCursor=null\n</commands>\n<requirements>\nYour query must accept `$endCursor` and return `pageInfo { hasNextPage endCursor }` from the collection you''re paging.\n</requirements>\n</phase>\n</graphql_usage>\n\n<integration_notes>\n<oss_discovery_workflow>\nPreferred local auth path:\n- Login once: `gh auth login`\n- Run discovery: `./.blackbox/scripts/start-oss-discovery-cycle.sh`\n\nToken fallback path (use only if needed):\n<commands>\n# Set GITHUB_TOKEN in your shell (from gh, without printing it)\nexport GITHUB_TOKEN=\"$(gh auth token)\"\n\n# Run your scripts\n./.blackbox/scripts/start-oss-discovery-and-curate.sh --owner \"Shaan\" --top 25 -- --min-stars 100\n\n# Optional cleanup\nunset GITHUB_TOKEN\n</commands>\n</oss_discovery_workflow>\n</integration_notes>\n\n<rules>\n<security_rules>\n- Never paste tokens into chat or commit them into files\n- Prefer `gh` for local \"agentic\" runs because it keeps auth out of the repo\n- Don''t run `gh auth token` in shared terminals/screenshares\n- Don''t paste token strings into docs/chat\n</security_rules>\n\n<incident_response>\nIf you accidentally pasted a token somewhere public:\n1. **Revoke it immediately** in GitHub Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens\n2. Assume it is compromised once exposed\n</incident_response>\n</rules>\n\n<troubleshooting>\n<issue condition=\"Not logged in\">\n<solution>\n```bash\ngh auth status\ngh auth login\n```\n</solution>\n</issue>\n\n<issue condition=\"Insufficient scopes / resource not accessible\">\n<solution>\nAdd scopes (minimally) and retry:\n```bash\ngh auth refresh --scopes \"read:org\"\n```\n</solution>\n</issue>\n\n<issue condition=\"Multiple accounts / hosts confusion\">\n<solution>\nList auth contexts:\n```bash\ngh auth status\n```\nSwitch host:\n```bash\ngh auth login --hostname github.company.com\n```\n</solution>\n</issue>\n</troubleshooting>\n\n<done_checklist>\n- [ ] `gh --version` works\n- [ ] `gh auth status` shows \"Logged in\"\n- [ ] `gh api graphql -f query=''query { viewer { login } }''` returns your login\n- [ ] You can run the OSS discovery scripts without hitting immediate rate limits\n</done_checklist>\n</instructions>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:19:55.611Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automation Agents requiring secure and authenticated GitHub API access for tasks like repository management and metadata fetching","zh":"适合需要安全和认证的GitHub API访问的自动化代理，用于任务如仓库管理和元数据获取","ja":"GitHub APIへの安全で認証されたアクセスを必要とする自動化エージェントに適しています。リポジトリ管理やメタデータの取得などのタスクに使用できます","ko":"GitHub API에 대한 보안 인증이 필요한 자동화 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 저장소 관리 및 메타데이터 가져오기와 같은 작업에 사용할 수 있습니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización que requieren acceso seguro y autenticado a la API de GitHub para tareas como la gestión de repositorios y la recuperación de metadatos","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Automatisation nécessitant un accès sécurisé et authentifié à l''API GitHub pour des tâches telles que la gestion de référentiels et la récupération de métadonnées","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungsagenten, die sicheren und authentifizierten Zugriff auf die GitHub-API für Aufgaben wie Repository-Verwaltung und Metadatenabruf benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação que exigem acesso à API do GitHub seguro e autenticado para tarefas como gerenciamento de repositórios e busca de metadados","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации, требующих безопасного и аутентифицированного доступа к API GitHub для задач, таких как управление репозиториями и получение метаданных","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل التutomatiون التي تتطلب وصول آمن وموثوق إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub لمهام مثل إدارة المستودعات و استرداد البيانات الوصفية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to securely authenticate with GitHub using the CLI, enabling reliable API access with higher rate limits for tasks such as searching open-source repositories, fetching repository metadata, and running GraphQL queries for richer and faster lookups via the GitHub API and GraphQL protocol","zh":"赋予代理使用CLI安全地与GitHub进行身份验证的能力，从而实现对GitHub API和GraphQL协议的可靠访问，并为任务如搜索开源仓库、获取仓库元数据、运行GraphQL查询提供更高的速率限制和更快的查询","ja":"CLIを使用してGitHubと安全に認証するエージェントの能力を提供し、GitHub APIおよびGraphQLプロトコルへの信頼性の高いアクセスを可能にします。オープンソースリポジトリの検索、リポジトリメタデータの取得、GraphQLクエリの実行などのタスクでより高いレート制限とより迅速な検索が可能になります","ko":"에이전트가 CLI를 사용하여 GitHub과 안전하게 인증할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 GitHub API 및 GraphQL 프로토콜에 대한 안정적인 액세스를 가능하게 하며, 오픈 소스 저장소 검색, 저장소 메타데이터 가져오기, GraphQL 쿼리 실행 등의 작업에서 더 높은 속도 제한과 더 빠른 조회를 제공합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a autenticarse de forma segura con GitHub utilizando la CLI, lo que permite un acceso API confiable con límites de velocidad más altos para tareas como la búsqueda de repositorios de código abierto, la recuperación de metadatos de repositorio y la ejecución de consultas GraphQL para búsquedas más rápidas y ricas a través de la API y el protocolo GraphQL de GitHub","fr":"Permet aux agents de s''authentifier de manière sécurisée avec GitHub en utilisant la CLI, ce qui permet un accès API fiable avec des limites de débit plus élevées pour des tâches telles que la recherche de référentiels open source, la récupération de métadonnées de référentiel et l''exécution de requêtes GraphQL pour des recherches plus rapides et plus riches via l''API et le protocole GraphQL de GitHub","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sich sicher mit GitHub über die CLI zu authentifizieren, wodurch ein zuverlässiger API-Zugriff mit höheren Rate Limits für Aufgaben wie die Suche nach Open-Source-Repositorys, das Abrufen von Repository-Metadaten und das Ausführen von GraphQL-Abfragen für schnellere und umfassendere Suchvorgänge über die GitHub-API und das GraphQL-Protokoll ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a se autenticarem de forma segura no GitHub usando a CLI, permitindo acesso à API confiável com limites de taxa mais altos para tarefas, como pesquisar repositórios de código aberto, buscar metadados de repositório e executar consultas GraphQL para pesquisas mais ricas e rápidas via API e protocolo GraphQL do GitHub","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью безопасной аутентификации в GitHub с помощью CLI, обеспечивая надежный доступ к API с более высокими лимитами скорости для задач, таких как поиск репозиториев с открытым исходным кодом, получение метаданных репозитория и выполнение запросов GraphQL для более богатых и быстрых поисков через API и протокол GraphQL GitHub","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من التحقق من مصداقيته بشكل آمن على منصة GitHub باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر ، مما يتيح الوصول الموثوق إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات بحدود معدل أعلى لمهام مثل البحث في مستودعات البرامج مفتوحة المصدر ، واسترجاع بيانات وصف المستودع ، و تشغيل استفسارات GraphQL من أجل عمليات البحث الأغنى وأسرع عبر واجهة برمجة التطبيقات و بروتوكول GraphQL لمنصة GitHub"},"useCases":{"en":["Authenticating with GitHub CLI for secure automation","Fetching repository metadata for analysis","Running GraphQL queries for efficient data retrieval"],"zh":["使用GitHub CLI进行安全的自动化身份验证","获取仓库元数据进行分析","运行GraphQL查询以实现高效的数据检索"],"ja":["GitHub CLIを使用した安全な自動化の認証","リポジトリメタデータの取得と分析","GraphQLクエリを実行して効率的なデータ取得を実現"],"ko":["GitHub CLI를 사용한 보안 자동화 인증","저장소 메타데이터를 가져와 분석하기","GraphQL 쿼리를 실행하여 효율적인 데이터 검색을 구현"],"es":["Autenticación con la CLI de GitHub para automatización segura","Recuperación de metadatos de repositorio para análisis","Ejecución de consultas GraphQL para recuperación eficiente de datos"],"fr":["Authentification avec la CLI GitHub pour une automatisation sécurisée","Récupération de métadonnées de référentiel pour analyse","Exécution de requêtes GraphQL pour une récupération de données efficiente"],"de":["Authentifizierung mit der GitHub-CLI für sichere Automatisierung","Abrufen von Repository-Metadaten für Analyse","Ausführen von GraphQL-Abfragen für effizientes Datenabrufen"],"pt":["Autenticar com a CLI do GitHub para automação segura","Buscar metadados de repositório para análise","Executar consultas GraphQL para recuperação eficiente de dados"],"ru":["Аутентификация с помощью CLI GitHub для безопасной автоматизации","Получение метаданных репозитория для анализа","Выполнение запросов GraphQL для эффективного извлечения данных"],"ar":["التحقق من صحة الهوية باستخدام واجهة سطر أوامر GitHub من أجل آليّة آمنة","استرجاع بيانات وصف المستودع من أجل التحليل","تشغيل استفسارات GraphQL من أجل استرجاع البيانات بفعالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI installation and configuration","Needs GitHub personal access token for authentication"],"zh":["需要安装和配置GitHub CLI","需要GitHub个人访问令牌进行身份验证"],"ja":["GitHub CLIのインストールと設定が必要","認証にはGitHubの個人アクセストークンが必要"],"ko":["GitHub CLI 설치 및 구성이 필요합니다","인증을 위해 GitHub 개인 액세스 토큰이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de la CLI de GitHub","Necesita un token de acceso personal de GitHub para la autenticación"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de la CLI GitHub","Nécessite un jeton d''accès personnel GitHub pour l''authentification"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation und Konfiguration der GitHub-CLI","Benötigt ein persönliches GitHub-Zugriffstoken für die Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Exige instalação e configuração da CLI do GitHub","Necessita de token de acesso pessoal do GitHub para autenticação"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки CLI GitHub","Требует личного токена доступа GitHub для аутентификации"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين واجهة سطر أوامر GitHub","يحتاج إلى رمز وصول شخصي لمنصة GitHub من أجل التحقق من الصحة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8f1cb603a4f4a3290923a8e51b0c051524075241ddccfb3371f9c31051c0067d","qualityScore":65}');
