ات هبوط لتحويل مع Shadcn و Vite","en":"shadcn-vite-iconify-landing-page"},"description":{"zh":"Shadcn Vite Iconify, 5 ","ja":"Shadcn Vite Iconify, 5 ","ko":"Shadcn Vite Iconify, 5 ","es":"Shadcn + Vite ofrece una forma efectiva de crear páginas de destino que convierten, con Iconify para una experiencia de usuario mejorada","fr":"Shadcn + Vite propose une façon efficace de créer des pages de destination qui convertissent, avec Iconify pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée","de":"Shadcn + Vite bietet eine effektive Möglichkeit, konvertierende Landingpages zu erstellen, mit Iconify für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung","pt":"O Shadcn + Vite é uma combinação poderosa para criar páginas de destino que convertem. Aprenda a criar uma experiência de usuário atraente e funcional.","ru":"Shadcn + Vite - это мощная комбинация для создания страниц приземления, которые конвертируют. Узнайте, как создать привлекательный и функциональный опыт поль...","ar":"Shadcn + Vite هو مزيج قوي لإنشاء صفحات هبوط تتحول. تعلم كيفية إنشاء تجربة مستخدم جذابة و وظيفية.","en":"A curated collection of my agent-skills"},"definition":{"en":"A curated collection of my agent-skills"},"features":{"zh":["Shadcn Vite","Iconify","5 ","Tailwind","Shadcn"],"ja":["Shadcn Vite","Iconify","5 ","Tailwind","Shadcn"],"ko":["Shadcn Vite","Iconify","5 ","Tailwind","Shadcn"],"es":["Diseño de página de destino personalizable","Implementación con Shadcn y Tailwind","Iconos personalizables con Iconify","Optimización para conversiones","Diseño responsivo"],"fr":["Conception de page de destination personnalisable","Mise en œuvre avec Shadcn et Tailwind","Icônes personnalisables avec Iconify","Optimisation pour les conversions","Conception responsive"],"de":["Anpassbares Landingpage-Design","Implementierung mit Shadcn und Tailwind","Anpassbare Symbole mit Iconify","Optimierung für Konversionen","Responsives Design"],"pt":["Crie páginas de destino personalizadas","Melhore a experiência do usuário com Iconify","Aumente as conversões com uma estrutura de página eficaz","Utilize Shadcn e Vite para uma combinação poderosa","Desenvolva páginas de destino responsivas e móveis"],"ru":["Создайте индивидуальные страницы приземления","Улучшите опыт пользователя с помощью Iconify","Увеличьте конверсии с помощью эффективной структуры страницы","Используйте Shadcn и Vite для мощной комбинации","Разработайте адаптивные и мобильные страницы приземления"],"ar":["إنشاء صفحات هبوط مخصصة","تحسين تجربة المستخدم مع Iconify","زيادة التحويلات ببنية صفحة فعالة","استخدام Shadcn و Vite لمزيج قوي","تطوير صفحات هبوط قابلة للتكيف و الموبايل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Shadcn Vite","Iconify","Vite","Shadcn","Tailwind","SEO"," "],"ja":["Shadcn Vite","Iconify","Vite","Shadcn","Tailwind","SEO"," "],"ko":["Shadcn Vite","Iconify","Vite","Shadcn","Tailwind","SEO"," "],"es":["página de destino","Shadcn","Vite","Iconify","diseño de página","optimización para conversiones","desarrollo web","landing page","conversión"],"fr":["page de destination","Shadcn","Vite","Iconify","conception de page","optimisation pour les conversions","développement web","landing page","conversion"],"de":["Landingpage","Shadcn","Vite","Iconify","Seitendesign","Optimierung für Konversionen","Webentwicklung","Landingpage-Design","Konversion"],"pt":["páginas de destino","Shadcn","Vite","Iconify","conversões","experiência do usuário","desenvolvimento web","responsivo","móvel"],"ru":["страницы приземления","Shadcn","Vite","Iconify","конверсии","опыт пользователя","веб-разработка","адаптивный","мобильный"],"ar":["صفحات هبوط","Shadcn","Vite","Iconify","تحويلات","تجربة المستخدم","تطوير الويب","قابل للتكيف","موبايل"]}},"owner":"regenrek","repo":"agent-skills","repoPath":"regenrek/agent-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.574Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shadcn-vite-iconify-landing-page","description":"Build, critique, and iterate high-converting marketing or product landing pages using React + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind and shadcn/ui components, with all icons sourced from Iconify. Use when the user asks for a landing page, sales page, signup page, CRO improvements, above-the-fold vs below-the-fold structure, hero + CTA copy, section order, or wants production-ready shadcn + Vite code.","bodyPreview":"# Shadcn + Vite landing pages that convert (with Iconify)\n\n## Quick start\n\n1. Identify the single primary conversion action (the one CTA that matters).\n2. Draft the page using the anatomy below.\n3. Nail above-the-fold first (title, subheadline, visual, proof, CTA).\n4. Use below-the-fold to remove doubt (features, proof, FAQ, repeat CTA).\n5. Implement in shadcn + Tailwind with a distinctive, intentional aesthetic.\n\nIf the user provides an existing page, run the same checklist as an audit and prop","body":"# Shadcn + Vite landing pages that convert (with Iconify)\n\n## Quick start\n\n1. Identify the single primary conversion action (the one CTA that matters).\n2. Draft the page using the anatomy below.\n3. Nail above-the-fold first (title, subheadline, visual, proof, CTA).\n4. Use below-the-fold to remove doubt (features, proof, FAQ, repeat CTA).\n5. Implement in shadcn + Tailwind with a distinctive, intentional aesthetic.\n\nIf the user provides an existing page, run the same checklist as an audit and propose specific fixes and A/B tests.\n\n## Default stack and rules\n\nDefault stack:\n- React + Vite + TypeScript\n- Tailwind CSS (prefer v4)\n- shadcn/ui components (added via CLI, then customized)\n- Iconify icons (no lucide-react)\n\nRules:\n- One primary CTA, one secondary CTA max above the fold.\n- One icon family (or at most two) per page.\n- Use shadcn components for accessibility and consistency, but do not let them dictate a generic layout.\n\nFor project setup commands (Vite + Tailwind + shadcn), see `references/shadcn-vite-setup.md`.\n\n## Core landing page anatomy\n\nUse this default order unless the user has a strong reason to deviate:\n\n1. Navigation (minimal, de-emphasize links that compete with the primary CTA)\n2. Hero (value + approach + visual)\n3. Social proof (logos, testimonials, numbers)\n4. Primary CTA block (repeat CTA if hero is dense)\n5. Features (value proof, outcomes, differentiators)\n6. CTA repeated 1 to 2 times (after key persuasion moments)\n7. Footer (secondary links, legal, contact)\n\nSee `references/landing-page-anatomy.md` for the full checklists and annotated examples.\n\n## Above-the-fold checklist\n\nTreat ''above the fold'' as the content visible before scrolling on common viewports.\n\n1. Define the value you offer (title)\n2. Detail your approach (subheadline)\n3. Help the user envision it (visual)\n4. Establish credibility (social proof)\n5. Simplify the next step (call to action)\n\nImplementation rules:\n- Make the primary CTA unmissable.\n- Make the visual concrete (product UI, before/after, outcome preview), not decorative.\n- Reduce friction with microcopy (no credit card, 60 seconds, cancel anytime).\n\n## Below-the-fold persuasion sequence\n\n1. Show clear value (features)\n2. Motivate to action (social proof)\n3. Clarify questions (FAQ)\n4. Repeat your call to action (CTA)\n\nAdd sections only if they remove doubt (pricing, security, comparisons, case studies, integrations).\n\n## Output patterns to produce\n\nChoose the lightest deliverable that satisfies the user''s request.\n\n### A) New landing page\n\nProvide:\n- Page goal, audience, offer, and primary CTA\n- Section-by-section outline mapped to the anatomy\n- Hero copy options (3 variations) and CTA microcopy\n- Proof plan (what to show and where)\n- Implementation: production-grade React code (shadcn + Tailwind + Iconify)\n\n### B) Landing page audit\n\nProvide:\n- A short diagnosis: what is the page asking the user to do and is it obvious\n- Issues and fixes grouped by: Above-the-fold, Below-the-fold, CTA, Proof, Copy, Design/UX, Performance\n- 5 to 10 prioritized recommendations (impact vs effort)\n- 3 A/B test ideas with clear hypotheses\n\n## Shadcn component mapping\n\nPrefer these building blocks:\n- Navigation: `Button`, `Sheet` (mobile menu), `Separator`\n- Hero: `Button`, `Badge`, `Card` (for a framed visual), `Input` (only if email capture is the CTA)\n- Social proof: `Card`, `Avatar` (testimonials), `Badge` (press or awards)\n- Features: `Card`, `Tabs` (only if comparison is critical)\n- FAQ: `Accordion`\n- Final CTA: `Card`, `Button`\n\nAdd only the components you actually use.\n\n## Icons (Iconify only)\n\nDefault icon source: https://icon-sets.iconify.design/\n\nSelection rules:\n- Pick one icon set prefix and stay consistent (example: `lucide:*` for a clean outline style).\n- Use icons to clarify hierarchy, not to decorate.\n- Accessibility: decorative icons should be `aria-hidden=\"true\"`; meaningful icons should have text nearby.\n\nReact usage:\n\n```bash\nnpm i @iconify/react\n```\n\n```tsx\nimport { Icon } from ''@iconify/react''\n\nexport function IconBullet() {\n  return (\n    <span className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <Icon icon=\"lucide:check\" aria-hidden=\"true\" className=\"size-4\" />\n      <span>Cancel anytime</span>\n    </span>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nNotes:\n- `@iconify/react` loads icon data on demand by default. Use an offline approach only if the user requires zero network dependence.\n- Do not add `lucide-react` unless the user explicitly requests it.\n\nOptional: create an `AppIcon` wrapper for consistent sizing and accessibility. See `references/iconify.md`.\n\n## Design execution (distinctive, non-generic)\n\nBefore writing code, decide:\n- Purpose: what problem does this page solve and for whom\n- Tone: commit to a bold direction (editorial, brutalist, luxury minimal, retro utilitarian, playful, etc.)\n- Constraints: performance, accessibility, brand rules\n- Differentiation: one memorable detail (layout twist, signature motion moment, unique motif)\n\nThen execute with craft.\n\nTypography\n- Choose characterful fonts. Avoid generic defaults.\n- Pair one display face (headlines) with a readable body face.\n\nColor and theme\n- Use a cohesive palette with 1 to 2 dominant colors and sharp accents.\n- Prefer CSS variables (shadcn theme tokens) so the design stays consistent.\n\nMotion\n- Use motion as guidance, not decoration: staged reveals, CTA emphasis, proof highlights.\n- Prefer a few high-impact moments over many micro animations.\n\nSpatial composition\n- Use deliberate hierarchy and whitespace.\n- Break the grid only when it improves clarity.\n\nFor quick presets, see `references/aesthetic-directions.md`.\n\n## Implementation requirements\n\n- Use semantic HTML and accessible components (labels, focus states, reduced motion support).\n- Mobile-first responsive layout.\n- Optimize perceived performance: avoid heavy hero media, lazy-load below-the-fold images.\n- Keep the primary CTA consistent (label, destination, and promise).\n\n## Included starter asset\n\nIf the user asks for a starter page scaffold, use:\n- `assets/vite-shadcn-iconify-landing/src/pages/LandingPage.tsx`\n\nThis is a sectioned template that matches the anatomy and uses shadcn + Iconify.\n\n## Reference files\n\n- `references/shadcn-vite-setup.md`: install and configure shadcn/ui for Vite (Tailwind, aliases, CLI)\n- `references/iconify.md`: Iconify rules + an `AppIcon` wrapper component\n- `references/section-templates.md`: copy-paste section templates (Navbar, Hero, Proof, Features, FAQ, CTA, Footer)\n- `references/landing-page-anatomy.md`: anatomy, above/below-the-fold checklists, annotated examples\n- `references/copy-templates.md`: hero formulas, CTA microcopy, FAQ templates\n- `references/aesthetic-directions.md`: bold aesthetic presets to pick from quickly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:33:56.093Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing high-conversion landing page design with Shadcn and Vite integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高转换率登陆页设计并集成了Shadcn和Vite的前端代理","ja":"ShadcnとViteの統合を必要とするフロントエンドエージェント向けの高転換率ランディングページ設計に最適","ko":"Shadcn과 Vite 통합이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트를 위한 높은 전환률 랜딩 페이지 디자인에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un diseño de página de destino con alta conversión y integración con Shadcn y Vite.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une conception de page de destination à forte conversion avec une intégration Shadcn et Vite.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die ein Landingpage-Design mit hoher Konvertierung und Shadcn- sowie Vite-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de design de página de destino de alta conversão com integração do Shadcn e Vite.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходим дизайн страницы высадки с высокой конверсией и интеграцией Shadcn и Vite.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى تصميم صفحة هبوط عالية التحويل مع دمج Shadcn و Vite."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create conversion-focused landing pages using Shadcn, Vite, and Iconify, providing a distinctive aesthetic with Tailwind and intentional above-the-fold design.","zh":"赋予代理创建以Shadcn、Vite和Iconify为中心的转换焦点型登陆页，并通过Tailwind和故意的上折页设计提供独特的美学","ja":"Shadcn、Vite、Iconifyを使用した転換重点型ランディングページの作成をエージェントに可能とし、Tailwindと意図的な上部折り畳み設計で独自の美しさを提供する","ko":"에이전트가 Shadcn, Vite, Iconify를 사용하여 전환 중심 랜딩 페이지를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, Tailwind와 의도적인 위쪽 折り畳み 디자인으로 고유한 미학을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear páginas de destino enfocadas en la conversión utilizando Shadcn, Vite e Iconify, proporcionando una estética distintiva con Tailwind y un diseño intencional por encima de la línea de plegado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des pages de destination axées sur la conversion en utilisant Shadcn, Vite et Iconify, offrant une esthétique distinctive avec Tailwind et une conception intentionnelle au-dessus de la ligne de pli.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, konversionsorientierte Landingpages mit Shadcn, Vite und Iconify zu erstellen, wodurch eine distinktive Ästhetik mit Tailwind und ein intentionales Design über der Falzlinie bereitgestellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar páginas de destino focadas na conversão usando Shadcn, Vite e Iconify, fornecendo uma estética distinta com Tailwind e design intencional acima da dobra.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать страницы высадки, ориентированные на конверсию, с использованием Shadcn, Vite и Iconify, обеспечивая характерный эстетический вид с Tailwind и намеренным дизайном выше сгиба.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء صفحات هبوط تركز على التحويل باستخدام Shadcn و Vite و Iconify، وتقديم مظهر جمالي متميز مع Tailwind وتصميم مقصود فوق الطي."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing high-conversion landing pages with Iconify","Auditing existing pages for conversion optimization","Implementing intentional above-the-fold design with Shadcn and Tailwind"],"zh":["使用Iconify设计高转换率登陆页","审计现有页面以进行转换率优化","使用Shadcn和Tailwind实现故意的上折页设计"],"ja":["Iconifyを使用した高転換率ランディングページの設計","既存のページの転換率最適化のための監査","ShadcnとTailwindを使用した意図的な上部折り畳み設計の実装"],"ko":["Iconify를 사용하여 높은 전환률 랜딩 페이지 디자인","既存 페이지의 전환률 최적화를 위한 감사","Shadcn과 Tailwind를 사용하여 의도적인 위쪽 折り畳み 디자인 구현"],"es":["Diseñar páginas de destino con alta conversión con Iconify","Auditar páginas existentes para la optimización de la conversión","Implementar un diseño intencional por encima de la línea de plegado con Shadcn y Tailwind"],"fr":["Concevoir des pages de destination à forte conversion avec Iconify","Auditer des pages existantes pour l''optimisation de la conversion","Mettre en œuvre une conception intentionnelle au-dessus de la ligne de pli avec Shadcn et Tailwind"],"de":["Entwerfen von Landingpages mit hoher Konvertierung mit Iconify","Auditing bestehender Seiten für die Konvertierungs-Optimierung","Implementieren eines intentionalen Designs über der Falzlinie mit Shadcn und Tailwind"],"pt":["Projetar páginas de destino de alta conversão com Iconify","Auditar páginas existentes para otimização de conversão","Implementar design intencional acima da dobra com Shadcn e Tailwind"],"ru":["Проектирование страниц высадки с высокой конверсией с помощью Iconify","Аудит существующих страниц для оптимизации конверсии","Реализация намеренного дизайна выше сгиба с Shadcn и Tailwind"],"ar":["تصميم صفحات هبوط عالية التحويل مع Iconify","فحص صفحات موجودة لتحسين التحويل","تنفيذ تصميم مقصود فوق الطي مع Shadcn و Tailwind"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Shadcn, Vite, and Tailwind","Limited to landing page design and optimization"],"zh":["需要了解Shadcn、Vite和Tailwind","仅限于登陆页设计和优化"],"ja":["Shadcn、Vite、Tailwindの知識が必要","ランディングページの設計と最適化のみに限定される"],"ko":["Shadcn, Vite, Tailwind에 대한 지식이 필요","랜딩 페이지 디자인 및 최적화에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Shadcn, Vite y Tailwind","Limitado al diseño y optimización de páginas de destino"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en Shadcn, Vite et Tailwind","Limité à la conception et à l''optimisation de pages de destination"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Shadcn, Vite und Tailwind","Begrenzt auf das Design und die Optimierung von Landingpages"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de Shadcn, Vite e Tailwind","Limitado ao design e otimização de páginas de destino"],"ru":["Требует знаний Shadcn, Vite и Tailwind","Ограничен дизайном и оптимизацией страниц высадки"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة Shadcn و Vite و Tailwind","محدود بتصميم و تحسين صفحات الهبوط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f83f805332784196eae9f928e2b839a76e9567d5acc0d7b94e8b8a0d54ab7455","qualityScore":65}');
