er, Python.","ko":"uv-python-tool-installer, Python .","es":"El instalador de herramientas de Python UV te permite instalar herramientas de Python con un solo comando. Soporta macOS, Linux y Windows.","fr":"L''installeur d''outils Python UV vous permet d''installer des outils Python avec une seule commande. Il prend en charge macOS, Linux et Windows.","de":"Der UV Python Tool Installer ermöglicht es Ihnen, Python-Tools mit einem einzigen Befehl zu installieren. Es unterstützt macOS, Linux und Windows.","pt":"O instalador de ferramentas Python UV é uma ferramenta que permite instalar pacotes Python com facilidade","ru":"Установщик инструментов Python UV — это инструмент, который позволяет легко устанавливать пакеты Python","ar":"مثبت أدوات بايثون يو في هو أداة تمكنك من تثبيت حزم بايثون بسهولة","en":"OpenMateCode of opencode,  just branch from MateBot, using free token anytime with tg"},"definition":{"en":"OpenMateCode of opencode,  just branch from MateBot, using free token anytime with tg"},"features":{"zh":["Python "," "," ","PyPI"," "],"ja":["Python ","","","PyPI",""],"ko":["Python "," "," ","PyPI"," "],"es":["Instalación de herramientas de Python con un solo comando","Soporte para macOS, Linux y Windows","Instalación de versiones específicas de herramientas","Uso de PyPI para la instalación de paquetes","Compatibilidad con ruff y otras herramientas"],"fr":["Installation d''outils Python avec une seule commande","Prise en charge de macOS, Linux et Windows","Installation de versions spécifiques d''outils","Utilisation de PyPI pour l''installation de paquets","Compatibilité avec ruff et d''autres outils"],"de":["Installation von Python-Tools mit einem einzigen Befehl","Unterstützung für macOS, Linux und Windows","Installation von spezifischen Versionen von Tools","Verwendung von PyPI für die Installation von Paketen","Kompatibilität mit ruff und anderen Tools"],"pt":["Instalação de pacotes Python com um único comando","Suporte a plataformas macOS, Linux e Windows","Instalação de versões específicas de pacotes","Uso de comandos bash e powershell","Integração com o gerenciador de pacotes PyPI"],"ru":["Установка пакетов Python с помощью одного команды","Поддержка платформ macOS, Linux и Windows","Установка конкретных версий пакетов","Использование команд bash и powershell","Интеграция с менеджером пакетов PyPI"],"ar":["تثبيت حزم بايثون باستخدام أمر واحد","دعم منصات ماك و لينكس و ويندوز","تثبيت إصدارات محددة من الحزم","استخدام أوامر باش و باور شيل","التكامل مع مدير الحزم بي بي آي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["uv-python-tool-installer","Python ","PyPI"," "," "," "],"ja":["uv-python-tool-installer","Python","PyPI","","",""],"ko":["uv-python-tool-installer","Python ","PyPI"," "," "," "],"es":["instalador de herramientas de python","uv python tool installer","instalación de herramientas de python","herramientas de python","ruff","pypi","macos","linux","windows"],"fr":["installeur d''outils python","uv python tool installer","installation d''outils python","outils python","ruff","pypi","macos","linux","windows"],"de":["python tool installer","uv python tool installer","installation von python tools","python tools","ruff","pypi","macos","linux","windows"],"pt":["instalador de ferramentas python","uv python tool installer","instalar pacotes python","ferramentas de desenvolvimento python","gerenciador de pacotes pypi","comandos bash e powershell"],"ru":["установщик инструментов python","uv python tool installer","установка пакетов python","инструменты разработки python","менеджер пакетов pypi","команды bash и powershell"],"ar":["مثبت أدوات بايثون","مثبت أدوات بايثون يو في","تثبيت حزم بايثون","أدوات تطوير بايثون","مدير حزم بي بي آي","أوامر باش و باور شيل"]}},"owner":"aresbit","repo":"OpenMateCode","repoPath":"aresbit/OpenMateCode","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.576Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"uv-python-tool-installer","description":"Install Python command-line tools with a single command using uvx.sh (Astrals uv-based installer). Use when you need to install Python tools like ruff, black, mypy, or any PyPI package as a command-line tool. This skill provides simple curl commands for installing Python tools on macOS, Linux, and Windows.","bodyPreview":"# Uv Python Tool Installer\n\nInstall Python tools with a single command. Powered by [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/).\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### macOS and Linux\n\n```bash\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/<package>/install.sh | sh\n```\n\nReplace `<package>` with any PyPI package name.\n\n### Windows\n\n```bash\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy ByPass -c \"irm https://uvx.sh/<package>/install.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Install ruff\n\n```bash\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/ruff/install.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install a specific version\n\n```bash\ncur","body":"# Uv Python Tool Installer\n\nInstall Python tools with a single command. Powered by [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/).\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### macOS and Linux\n\n```bash\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/<package>/install.sh | sh\n```\n\nReplace `<package>` with any PyPI package name.\n\n### Windows\n\n```bash\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy ByPass -c \"irm https://uvx.sh/<package>/install.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Install ruff\n\n```bash\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/ruff/install.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install a specific version\n\n```bash\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/ruff/0.8.3/install.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Passing arguments\n\n```bash\n# Force installation\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/ruff/install.sh | sh -s -- --force\n\n# Install from a specific index\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/cmake/install.sh | sh -s -- --index https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu\n```\n\n## Scripts\n\n### `install.sh`\n\nSimple bash script to install Python tools:\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# Install Python tools using uvx.sh\n# Usage: ./install.sh <package> [version] [--force] [--index URL]\n\nPACKAGE=$1\nVERSION=$2\nshift 2\n\nif [ -n \"$VERSION\" ]; then\n    URL=\"https://uvx.sh/${PACKAGE}/${VERSION}/install.sh\"\nelse\n    URL=\"https://uvx.sh/${PACKAGE}/install.sh\"\nfi\n\ncurl -LsSf \"$URL\" | sh -s -- \"$@\"\n```\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n./scripts/install.sh ruff\n./scripts/install.sh ruff 0.8.3\n./scripts/install.sh ruff 0.8.3 --force\n```\n\n## Common Python Tools\n\n- `ruff` - Fast Python linter\n- `black` - Python code formatter  \n- `mypy` - Static type checker\n- `httpie` - Modern HTTP client\n- `pipx` - Install and run Python applications in isolated environments\n- `jupyter` - Jupyter notebooks\n- `poetry` - Python dependency management\n\n## Notes\n\n- Tools are installed to `~/.local/bin` by default\n- Ensure `~/.local/bin` is in your PATH\n- Uses `uv` under the hood for fast, reliable installation\n- Works with any PyPI package that provides command-line tools\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:42:20.056Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Development Agents needing streamlined package installation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要简化包安装功能的Python开发代理。","ja":"Python開発エージェントがストリーミングされたパッケージのインストール機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"파이썬 개발 에이전트가 패키지 설치 기능을 간소화해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Python que necesitan capacidades de instalación de paquetes optimizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Python ayant besoin de capacités d''installation de packages simplifiées.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine optimierte Paketinstallation benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Python que necessitam de capacidades de instalação de pacotes otimizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Python, которым необходимы оптимизированные возможности установки пакетов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات تثبيت حزمة مجهزة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to install Python tools with a single command using uv, supporting packages from PyPI and handling installations on macOS, Linux, and Windows through bash and powershell scripts.","zh":"使代理能够使用uv和单个命令安装Python工具，支持PyPI上的包，并通过bash和powershell脚本在macOS、Linux和Windows上处理安装。","ja":"エージェントがuvと単一のコマンドを使用してPythonツールをインストールできるようにし、PyPI上的パッケージをサポートし、bashとpowershellスクリプトを使用してmacOS、Linux、Windows上的インストールを処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 uv와 단일 명령을 사용하여 파이썬 툴을 설치할 수 있도록 하며, PyPI上的 패키지를 지원하며, bash와 powershell 스크립트를 사용하여 macOS, Linux, Windows上的 설치를 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a instalar herramientas de Python con un solo comando utilizando uv, que admite paquetes de PyPI y gestiona las instalaciones en macOS, Linux y Windows a través de scripts bash y powershell.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''installer des outils Python avec une seule commande à l''aide de uv, en prenant en charge les packages de PyPI et en gérant les installations sur macOS, Linux et Windows via des scripts bash et powershell.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Python-Tools mit einem einzigen Befehl mithilfe von uv zu installieren, das Pakete von PyPI unterstützt und Installationen auf macOS, Linux und Windows über bash- und powershell-Skripte verwaltet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a instalar ferramentas Python com um único comando usando uv, suportando pacotes do PyPI e lidando com instalações em macOS, Linux e Windows por meio de scripts bash e powershell.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью устанавливать инструменты Python с помощью одной команды с использованием uv, поддерживая пакеты из PyPI и обрабатывая установки на macOS, Linux и Windows через скрипты bash и powershell.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية تثبيت أدوات بايثون باستخدام أمر واحد باستخدام uv، ودعم حزم من PyPI ومعالجة التثبيتات على نظام macOS و Linux و Windows من خلال سكريبتات bash و powershell."},"useCases":{"en":["Installing ruff for code linting","Setting up specific versions of packages for reproducibility","Automating development environment setups with uv"],"zh":["安装ruff进行代码linting","设置包的特定版本以实现可复现性","使用uv自动设置开发环境"],"ja":["コードlinting用のruffをインストールする","再現性のためにパッケージの特定のバージョンを設定する","uvを使用して開発環境を自動設定する"],"ko":["코드 linting용 ruff 설치","재현성을 위해 패키지의 특정 버전 설정","uv를 사용하여 개발 환경 자동 설정"],"es":["Instalar ruff para la verificación de código","Configurar versiones específicas de paquetes para la reproducibilidad","Automatizar la configuración de entornos de desarrollo con uv"],"fr":["Installer ruff pour le linting de code","Configurer des versions spécifiques de packages pour la reproductibilité","Automatiser la configuration des environnements de développement avec uv"],"de":["ruff für Code-Linter installieren","Spezifische Versionen von Paketen für Reproduzierbarkeit einrichten","Entwicklungsumgebungen mit uv automatisieren"],"pt":["Instalar ruff para análise de código","Configurar versões específicas de pacotes para reprodutibilidade","Automatizar configurações de ambiente de desenvolvimento com uv"],"ru":["Установка ruff для анализа кода","Настройка конкретных версий пакетов для воспроизводимости","Автоматизация настроек среды разработки с uv"],"ar":["تثبيت ruff لتحليل الشفرة","تكوين إصدارات محددة من الحزم لإعادة الإنتاجية","توفير إعدادات بيئة التطوير مع uv"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires internet access for package download","Limited to packages available on PyPI","macOS and Linux require bash, Windows requires powershell"],"zh":["需要互联网访问以下载包","仅限PyPI上的包","macOS和Linux需要bash，Windows需要powershell"],"ja":["パッケージのダウンロードにはインターネットアクセスが必要","PyPI上的パッケージのみ","macOSとLinuxはbashが必要、Windowsはpowershellが必要"],"ko":["패키지 다운로드를 위해 인터넷 접근이 필요","PyPI上的 패키지만 지원","macOS와 Linux는 bash가 필요, Windows는 powershell가 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a Internet para descargar paquetes","Limitado a paquetes disponibles en PyPI","macOS y Linux requieren bash, Windows requiere powershell"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à Internet pour télécharger les packages","Limité aux packages disponibles sur PyPI","macOS et Linux nécessitent bash, Windows nécessite powershell"],"de":["Benötigt Internetzugang zum Herunterladen von Paketen","Begrenzt auf auf PyPI verfügbare Pakete","macOS und Linux benötigen bash, Windows benötigt powershell"],"pt":["Requer acesso à internet para download de pacotes","Limitado a pacotes disponíveis no PyPI","macOS e Linux requerem bash, Windows requer powershell"],"ru":["Требует доступа к интернету для скачивания пакетов","Ограничен пакетами, доступными в PyPI","macOS и Linux требуют bash, Windows требует powershell"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الإنترنت لتنزيل الحزم","محدود بالحزم المتاحة في PyPI","يحتاج macOS و Linux إلى bash، ويحتاج Windows إلى powershell"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d4e9eca89db59d2c63a492211a36d04dd19ec9a60c34a0d093b3f19a37a47a9b","qualityScore":65}');
