ierung in Python","Verwendung von ClawdBot","Verwaltung von Spielebibliotheken","Automatisierungstools","Integration mit web_fetch"],"pt":["Implementação Python de OpenClaw","Ferramentas padrão como bash e leitura/escrita de arquivos","Busca na web e fetch de conteúdo","Gerenciamento de bibliotecas de jogos","Integração com ClawdBot"],"ru":["Реализация OpenClaw на Python","Стандартные инструменты, такие как bash и чтение/запись файлов","Поиск в сети и получение контента","Управление библиотекой игр","Интеграция с ClawdBot"],"ar":["تنفيذ لغة Python لمكتبة الألعاب مفتوحة المصدر OpenClaw","أدوات قياسية مثل bash وكتابة القراءة وكتابة الملفات","البحث على شبكة الإنترنت واسترجاع المحتوى","إدارة مكتبة الألعاب","التكامل مع ClawdBot"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GOG","OpenClaw","Python","AI","ClawdBot","web_fetch","web_search","GOG","Python"],"ja":["GOG","OpenClaw","Python","AI","ClawdBot","web_fetch","web_search","GOG","Python"],"ko":["GOG","OpenClaw","Python","AI","ClawdBot","web_fetch","web_search","GOG","Python"],"es":["GOG","OpenClaw","Asistente AI personal","Python","ClawdBot","Automatización","Juegos","Bibliotecas de juegos"],"fr":["GOG","OpenClaw","Assistant AI personnel","Python","ClawdBot","Automatisation","Jeux","Bibliothèques de jeux"],"de":["GOG","OpenClaw","Persönlicher AI-Assistent","Python","ClawdBot","Automatisierung","Spiele","Spielebibliotheken"],"pt":["GOG","OpenClaw","Python","Assistente AI","Gerenciamento de bibliotecas de jogos","Desenvolvimento de jogos","Plataforma de jogos","ClawdBot","Bibliotecas de jogos"],"ru":["GOG","OpenClaw","Python","Личный помощник AI","Управление библиотекой игр","Разработка игр","Платформа игр","ClawdBot","Библиотеки игр"],"ar":["GOG","OpenClaw","Python","مساعد إلكتروني ذكاء اصطناعي","إدارة مكتبة الألعاب","تنمية الألعاب","منصة الألعاب","ClawdBot","مكتبات الألعاب"]}},"owner":"futurewithvibe","repo":"openclaw-python","repoPath":"futurewithvibe/openclaw-python","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.576Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gog","description":"GOG.com games library management","version":"1.0.0","tags":["games","gog"],"bodyPreview":"# GOG Games\n\nGOG.com games library management\n\n## Available Tools\n\nThis skill uses ClawdBot''s standard tools:\n- **bash** - Execute commands\n- **read_file** - Read files\n- **write_file** - Write files  \n- **web_fetch** - Fetch web content\n- **web_search** - Search the web\n\n## Usage Examples\n\nUser: \"Help me with gog games\"\n1. Assess what the user needs\n2. Use appropriate tools\n3. Provide helpful response\n\n## Configuration\n\nCheck documentation for specific setup requirements.\n\n## Notes\n\nThis skill","body":"# GOG Games\n\nGOG.com games library management\n\n## Available Tools\n\nThis skill uses ClawdBot''s standard tools:\n- **bash** - Execute commands\n- **read_file** - Read files\n- **write_file** - Write files  \n- **web_fetch** - Fetch web content\n- **web_search** - Search the web\n\n## Usage Examples\n\nUser: \"Help me with gog games\"\n1. Assess what the user needs\n2. Use appropriate tools\n3. Provide helpful response\n\n## Configuration\n\nCheck documentation for specific setup requirements.\n\n## Notes\n\nThis skill requires integration with GOG Games service/application.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:42:08.319Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Gaming Assistants needing GOG.com library management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要GOG.com图书馆管理功能的游戏助手。","ja":"GOG.comライブラリ管理機能が必要なゲーミングアシスタントに最適です。","ko":"GOG.com 라이브러리 관리 기능이 필요한 게임 어시스턴트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para asistentes de juegos que necesitan capacidades de gestión de biblioteca de GOG.com.","fr":"Parfait pour les assistants de jeux ayant besoin de capacités de gestion de bibliothèque GOG.com.","de":"Perfekt für Gaming-Assistenten, die Bibliotheksverwaltungsfunktionen für GOG.com benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Assistente de Jogos que precisam de capacidades de gerenciamento de biblioteca do GOG.com.","ru":"Идеально для игровых помощников, которым необходимы возможности управления библиотекой GOG.com.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللعبة الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات إدارة مكتبة GOG.com."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage GOG.com games libraries using ClawdBot''s standard tools, including bash, read_file, write_file, web_fetch, and web_search, enabling seamless interaction with the GOG Games platform via Python implementation of OpenClaw.","zh":"赋予代理管理GOG.com游戏库的能力，使用ClawdBot的标准工具，包括bash、read_file、write_file、web_fetch和web_search，通过Python实现的OpenClaw实现与GOG游戏平台的无缝交互。","ja":"ClawdBotの標準ツール（bash、read_file、write_file、web_fetch、web_searchなど）を使用して、GOG.comゲームライブラリを管理するエージェントを有効にし、Pythonで実装されたOpenClawを介してGOGゲームプラットフォームとのシームレスな相互作用を可能にします。","ko":"ClawdBot의 표준 도구(bash, read_file, write_file, web_fetch, web_search 등)를 사용하여 GOG.com 게임 라이브러리를 관리할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하고, Python으로 구현된 OpenClaw를 통해 GOG 게임 플랫폼과의 무제한 상호 작용을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar bibliotecas de juegos de GOG.com utilizando las herramientas estándar de ClawdBot, incluidas bash, read_file, write_file, web_fetch y web_search, lo que permite una interacción fluida con la plataforma de juegos GOG a través de la implementación de Python de OpenClaw.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les bibliothèques de jeux GOG.com en utilisant les outils standard de ClawdBot, notamment bash, read_file, write_file, web_fetch et web_search, permettant une interaction fluide avec la plateforme de jeux GOG via l''implémentation Python d''OpenClaw.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, GOG.com-Spielbibliotheken mit den Standardtools von ClawdBot zu verwalten, einschließlich bash, read_file, write_file, web_fetch und web_search, was eine nahtlose Interaktion mit der GOG-Spieleplattform über die Python-Implementierung von OpenClaw ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar bibliotecas de jogos do GOG.com usando as ferramentas padrão do ClawdBot, incluindo bash, read_file, write_file, web_fetch e web_search, permitindo interação sem problemas com a plataforma de jogos GOG por meio da implementação em Python do OpenClaw.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять библиотеками игр GOG.com с помощью стандартных инструментов ClawdBot, включая bash, read_file, write_file, web_fetch и web_search, обеспечивая беспрепятственное взаимодействие с платформой игр GOG посредством реализации OpenClaw на Python.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة مكتبات ألعاب GOG.com باستخدام أدوات ClawdBot القياسية، بما في ذلك bash و read_file و write_file و web_fetch و web_search، وتمكين التفاعل السلس مع منصة ألعاب GOG من خلال تنفيذ Python من OpenClaw."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating GOG games library updates","Fetching GOG games metadata","Searching for specific GOG games"],"zh":["自动更新GOG游戏库","获取GOG游戏元数据","搜索特定的GOG游戏"],"ja":["GOGゲームライブラリの自動更新","GOGゲームメタデータの取得","特定のGOGゲームの検索"],"ko":["GOG 게임 라이브러리의 자동 업데이트","GOG 게임 메타데이터의 검색","특정 GOG 게임의 검색"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de bibliotecas de juegos de GOG","Recuperar metadatos de juegos de GOG","Buscar juegos de GOG específicos"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour des bibliothèques de jeux GOG","Récupérer les métadonnées des jeux GOG","Rechercher des jeux GOG spécifiques"],"de":["Automatisierung von GOG-Spielbibliotheks-Updates","Abrufen von GOG-Spielmetadaten","Suchen nach bestimmten GOG-Spielen"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de biblioteca de jogos GOG","Buscar metadados de jogos GOG","Procurar jogos GOG específicos"],"ru":["Автоматизация обновлений библиотеки игр GOG","Получение метаданных игр GOG","Поиск определенных игр GOG"],"ar":["تحديث مكتبات ألعاب GOG تلقائيًا","استرجاع بيانات تعريف ألعاب GOG","البحث عن ألعاب GOG محددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GOG.com account access","Python implementation dependency","Limited to GOG Games platform"],"zh":["需要GOG.com账户访问","依赖Python实现","仅限GOG游戏平台"],"ja":["GOG.comアカウントへのアクセスが必要","Python実装への依存","GOGゲームプラットフォームのみ"],"ko":["GOG.com 계정 접근이 필요합니다","Python 구현 의존","GOG 게임 플랫폼만 해당"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la cuenta de GOG.com","Dependencia de la implementación de Python","Limitado a la plataforma de juegos GOG"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au compte GOG.com","Dépendance de l''implémentation Python","Limité à la plateforme de jeux GOG"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das GOG.com-Konto","Abhängigkeit von der Python-Implementierung","Begrenzt auf die GOG-Spieleplattform"],"pt":["Requer acesso à conta do GOG.com","Dependência de implementação em Python","Limitado à plataforma de jogos GOG"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к учетной записи GOG.com","Зависимость от реализации на Python","Ограниченная платформа игр GOG"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى حساب GOG.com","اعتماد تنفيذ Python","محدود بمكتبة ألعاب GOG"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"99c4bf82a90edd7d72980e50b10cf05c82901ed99cfc8a47568eca8304ee7099","qualityScore":65}');
