INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('mims-harvard/ToolUniverse/tooluniverse-precision-oncology', 'tooluniverse-precision-oncology', 'mims-harvard', 'ToolUniverse', 'community', 'tooluniverse-precision-oncology mims-harvard ToolUniverse community 提供基于分子特征的个性化肿瘤学治疗建议，包括FDA批准的治疗方案和临床试验的匹配 がん治療の最適な選択を提供するAIエージェント。分子特性に基づく治療提案と臨床試験のマッチング 분자 프로파일 기반의 정밀 종양학 치료 추천을 제공하는 AI 에이전트. FDA 승인 치료 및 임상시험 매칭 tooluniverse-precision-oncology proporciona recomendaciones de tratamiento para pacientes con cáncer basadas en su perfil molecular. Interpreta mutaciones tumorales y encuentra terapias aprobadas por la FDA tooluniverse-precision-oncology fournit des recommandations de traitement pour les patients atteints de cancer en fonction de leur profil moléculaire. Interprète les mutations tumorales et trouve des thérapies approuvées par la FDA tooluniverse-precision-oncology bietet Behandlungsempfehlungen für Krebspatienten basierend auf ihrem molekularen Profil. Interpretiert Tumormutationen und findet FDA-zugelassene Therapien O tooluniverse-precision-oncology é uma ferramenta de IA que fornece recomendações de tratamento personalizadas para pacientes com câncer com base em perfil molecular ИИ Агент tooluniverse-precision-oncology - это инструмент, который предоставляет персонализированные рекомендации по лечению рака на основе молекулярного профиля أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي tooluniverse-precision-oncology توفر توصيات علاجية مخصصة لمرضى السرطان بناءً على ملفهم الجزيئي Provide actionable treatment recommendations for cancer patients based on molecular profile. Interprets tumor mutations, identifies FDA-approved therapies, finds resistance mechanisms, matches clinical trials. Use when oncologist asks about treatment options for specific mutations (EGFR, KRAS, BR... AI工具 精准肿瘤学 个性化治疗 FDA批准 临床试验 如何使用AI工具 AI工具安装指南 Provide actionable treatment recommendations for cancer patients based on molecular profile. Interprets tumor mutations, identifies FDA-approved therapies, finds resistance mechanisms, matches clinical trials. Use when oncologist asks about treatment options for specific mutations (EGFR, KRAS, BRAF, etc.), therapy resistance, or clinical trial eligibility.');
